```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Geolocation Tracking</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>User Location Tracker</h1>
    <button id="getLocationButton">Get My Current Location</button>

    <script src="location.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

